 to right: the fetch stage with the next-PC multiplexer, the PC, a PC + 4 adder and the instruction memory; the IF/ID register; the decode stage with the decoders, the register file and the immediate generator; the ID/EX register; the execute stage with the ALU and its source multiplexer, the branch-condition block, the target multiplexer and adder, and a multiplexer that selects the execute-stage result; the EX/MEM register; the data memory; the MEM/WB register; and the write-back multiplexer. Its result and the destination register number return along the bottom to the register file, and the target returns to the next-PC multiplexer. Control signals are decoded in ID and carried through the pipeline registers along the top. This drawing adds the forwarding of the execute stage: before the ALU, each source passes a three-input forwarding multiplexer, input 0 the value from ID/EX, input 1 the WB result, input 2 the MEM result, selected by fwd_sel_a and fwd_sel_b.","variants":{"predictor":{"elements":[{"id":"immb","type":"comb","at":[2.15,-1.5],"size":[1,0.45],"text":"Imm. B"},{"id":"padd","type":"comb","at":[1,-1.9],"size":[0.5,0.7],"text":"+"},{"id":"pm","type":"mux2","at":[-1,0.4]}],"wires":[{"id":"imem_immb","style":"bus","arrow":true,"points":[[2.15,-0.9],[2.15,-1.275]],"signal":"instr_if","labels":[]},{"id":"pc_padd","style":"bus","arrow":true,"points":[[1.45,-1.75],[1.25,-1.75]],"signal":"pc_if","labels":[]},{"id":"immb_padd","style":"bus","arrow":true,"points":[[2.15,-1.725],[2.15,-2.05],[1.25,-2.05]],"signal":"imm_b_if","labels":[]},{"id":"padd_pm","style":"bus","arrow":true,"points":[[0.75,-1.9],[-1.35,-1.9],[-1.35,0],[-1,0]],"signal":"pc_pred_if","labels":[{"text":"pc_pred","at":[-0.55,-1.9],"place":"below"}]},{"id":"pc4_pm","style":"bus","arrow":true,"points":[[2.65,1.9],[2.65,2.35],[-1.5,2.35],[-1.5,0.8],[-1,0.8]],"signal":"pc_plus4_if","labels":[]},{"id":"pm_pcm","style":"bus","arrow":true,"points":[[-0.4,0.4],[0,0.4]],"signal":"pc_seq_if","labels":[]}],"control":[{"signal":"pred_if","text":"pred_if","points":[[-0.7,-0.75],[-0.7,-0.19999999999999996]],"place":"below"}],"labels":[],"junctions":[[1.45,-1.75]],"hide":["pc4_pcm"]}},"derivation":{"base":"FIG-0015 (pipelined datapath, without forwarding)","shift":"x > 3.6 cm moved right by 0.6 cm, x > 5.8 cm by a further 1.9 cm, x > 10.15 cm by a further 0.3 cm; the WB result and rd climb to wd and wa at 3.85 and 4.15 cm (author request 2026-10-27: wires spaced apart)","added":"forwarding multiplexers fa, fb (FIG-0017, drawn smaller), their WB and MEM feeds, fwd_sel_a and fwd_sel_b; rs1_fa and rs2_fb replace the operand connections of FIG-0015","variants":"predictor: the fetch-stage prediction hardware of rv32i_pipe.sv, drawn only while a predictor is selected (author decision, 2026-10-26)","review":"for the author's review against the book figures (WS-V-032)"}}
